  "description": "Su-Bin’s love life? A total dumpster fire. Every guy he dates is just another disappointment, and even the fortune teller he goes to for advice tells him his love life is cursed. As a muscular bottom, Su-Bin has about 0% appeal to the tops in his area…and the men he does manage to date? Yep, trash. Every. Single. Time. And so, Su-Bin swears off dating for good…until his literal dream guy walks into his life. He’s hot, he’s charming, and he’s totally Su-Bin’s type. But can he really be trusted, or is he just another beautifully wrapped disaster?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
